OL,3,AEleven killed in mass shooting at house
OL,4,Ain South Africa
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 11 people have been killed in
OL,7,Fa mass shooting in a residential
OL,8,Fbuilding near the South African city of
OL,9,FDurban.
OL,11,FGunmen stormed a house in the
OL,12,FKwaMakhutha township late on Tuesday
OL,13,Fand opened fire on 14 people. Ten were
OL,14,Fkilled at the scene and four were taken
OL,15,Fto hospital, where one later died from
OL,16,Ftheir injuries, police said.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
